                    normal_strength: 2.0,
                    prompt: "Seamless tileable top-down texture of a flat carpet of short dense alien moss with tiny faintly glowing teal spores, fine-grained and low-contrast so units remain readable on it, no large plants, no stones, no structures, stylized hand-painted sci-fi RTS ground, even diffuse lighting, no shadows, no perspective, no text, square",
                ),
